<title>UK: Peter Black buys Italy's Lenci shoe designer.</title>
<headline>Peter Black buys Italy's Lenci shoe designer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>British healthcare, beauty and fashion products manufacturer Peter Black Holdings said on Friday it is to buy 75 percent of Italian footwear designer Lenci for upto 11 million stg.</p>
<p>Lenci designs shoes at its own centre in Florence, where it employs over 40 people. Production is sourced from factories in Italy and eastern Europe.</p>
<p>&quot;We are confident that strong commercial and financial benefits will result from this acquisition,&quot; said chairman Gordon Black in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
